---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="关于我们 | 异宠指南" description="异宠指南的创立初衷与内容标准——为什么做这个网站，我们的内容如何保证质量，目前覆盖哪些异宠品种。">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="hero-pattern"></div>
      <div class="hero-decoration">
        <span class="deco-emoji">🌿</span>
        <span class="deco-emoji">🦎</span>
        <span class="deco-emoji">🌱</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-badge">ℹ️ 关于我们</span>
        <h1>关于异宠指南</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">系统化的异宠饲养知识库，从零开始</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="section mission-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mission-card">
        <div class="mission-icon">🎯</div>
        <h2>我们的使命</h2>
        <p class="mission-text">
          2026年的中文互联网，你想养一只守宫、一条玉米蛇或者一只鬃狮蜥，能去哪里找靠谱的信息？
        </p>
        <p class="mission-text">
          贴吧里帖子是散的，知乎上答案质量参差不齐，小红书种草帖只告诉你"可爱"不告诉你"责任"。
          新手往往在买完宠物之后才发现——饲养箱买小了、垫材用错了、温控没装对。
        </p>
        <p class="mission-text mission-highlight">
          <strong>异宠指南想做的，就是填补这个空白：一份系统化的、从零开始的、中文的异宠饲养知识库。</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Standards -->
  <section class="section standards-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">内容标准</span>
        <h2>我们的内容标准</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">每一篇文章都经过严格审核，确保信息准确可靠</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="standards-grid">
        <div class="standard-card">
          <div class="card-icon">📚</div>
          <h3>科学依据</h3>
          <p>每个参数都有出处，参考文献来自兽医手册、品种协会饲养标准、学术论文</p>
        </div>
        <div class="standard-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🤝</div>
          <h3>新手友好</h3>
          <p>不预设你养过任何宠物。每个概念第一次出现都会解释</p>
        </div>
        <div class="standard-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🔄</div>
          <h3>持续更新</h3>
          <p>饲养知识在进步，我们的文章也在迭代。每篇文章标注最后更新时间</p>
        </div>
        <div class="standard-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🚫</div>
          <h3>不做广告</h3>
          <p>推荐装备基于实际使用体验，不接受品牌付费推广</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Species Coverage -->
  <section class="section species-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">覆盖范围</span>
        <h2>目前覆盖的品种</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">持续更新中，更多品种饲养指南正在撰写</p>
      </div>

      <div class="species-grid">
        <div class="species-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-emoji">🦎</span>
            <h3>守宫类</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="species-list">
            <li>豹纹守宫</li>
            <li>睫角守宫</li>
            <li>肥尾守宫</li>
            <li>巨人守宫</li>
            <li>瘤尾守宫</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="species-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-emoji">🐍</span>
            <h3>蛇类</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="species-list">
            <li>玉米蛇</li>
            <li>球蟒</li>
            <li>王蛇</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="species-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-emoji">🦖</span>
            <h3>蜥蜴类</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="species-list">
            <li>鬃狮蜥</li>
            <li>蓝舌石龙子</li>
            <li>绿鬣蜥</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="species-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-emoji">🐸</span>
            <h3>蛙类</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="species-list">
            <li>角蛙</li>
            <li>老爷树蛙</li>
            <li>番茄蛙</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="species-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-emoji">🐢</span>
            <h3>陆龟类</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="species-list">
            <li>赫曼陆龟</li>
            <li>红腿陆龟</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="species-category species-more">
          <div class="more-content">
            <span class="more-icon">✨</span>
            <h3>更多品种</h3>
            <p>正在撰写中...</p>
            <a href="/species.html" class="btn btn-primary">查看物种大全</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team -->
  <section class="section team-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">团队</span>
        <h2>关于作者</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar">🌿</div>
        <div class="team-info">
          <h3>异宠指南</h3>
          <p class="team-role">内容创作者</p>
          <p class="team-bio">
            多年异宠饲养经验，专注于为新手提供系统化、科学化的饲养知识。
            相信好的内容可以减少不必要的"学费"，让每一位爱好者都能愉快地开始异宠之旅。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section class="section contact-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="contact-card">
        <div class="contact-content">
          <h2>联系我们</h2>
          <p>如果你有饲养经验想分享，或者发现了内容中的错误，欢迎通过以下方式联系：</p>
          
          <div class="contact-methods">
            <div class="contact-method">
              <span class="method-icon">📧</span>
              <div class="method-info">
                <span class="method-label">邮箱</span>
                <a href="mailto:hello@yi-chong-guide.pages.dev" class="method-value">hello@yi-chong-guide.pages.dev</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-cta">
            <a href="/blog.html" class="btn btn-primary">
              浏览全部文章
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/species.html" class="btn btn-secondary">
              查看物种大全
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="contact-decoration">
          <span class="deco-emoji">🦎</span>
          <span class="deco-emoji">🐍</span>
          <span class="deco-emoji">🐸</span>
          <span class="deco-emoji">🦖</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-50) 0%, var(--earth-50) 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0.03;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23000000' fill-opacity='1'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  }

  .hero-decoration {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: var(--space-8);
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .deco-emoji {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    opacity: 0.3;
    animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .deco-emoji:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1s; }
  .deco-emoji:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 2s; }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid var(--forest-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--forest-700);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--forest-900);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--max-width-xl);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-5);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--forest-900);
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Mission */
  .mission-section {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .mission-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mission-icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .mission-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    color: var(--forest-900);
  }

  .mission-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .mission-highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-100) 0%, var(--forest-50) 100%);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    color: var(--forest-800);
  }

  .mission-highlight strong {
    color: var(--forest-900);
  }

  /* Standards */
  .standards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .standard-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    text-align: center;
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .standard-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--forest-300);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .standard-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--forest-800);
  }

  .standard-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Species */
  .species-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--forest-50) 0%, var(--color-bg) 100%);
  }

  .species-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .species-category {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .species-category:hover {
    border-color: var(--forest-300);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .category-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .category-emoji {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .category-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--forest-800);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .species-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .species-list li {
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .species-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .species-more {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-100) 0%, var(--forest-50) 100%);
    border-color: var(--forest-200);
  }

  .more-content {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }

  .more-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .more-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--forest-800);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .more-content p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--forest-600);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  /* Team */
  .team-section {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .team-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .team-avatar {
    font-size: 5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .team-info h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--forest-900);
  }

  .team-role {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .team-bio {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Contact */
  .contact-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg) 0%, var(--forest-50) 100%);
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-600) 0%, var(--forest-800) 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    padding: var(--space-10);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    right: -20%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .contact-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .contact-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .contact-content > p {
    color: var(--forest-200);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .contact-methods {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .contact-method {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .method-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .method-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--forest-200);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .method-value {
    color: white;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .method-value:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .contact-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .contact-cta .btn-primary {
    background: white;
    color: var(--forest-700);
  }

  .contact-cta .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--forest-50);
    color: var(--forest-900);
  }

  .contact-cta .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: white;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .contact-cta .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: white;
  }

  .contact-decoration {
    position: absolute;
    right: var(--space-10);
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .contact-decoration .deco-emoji {
    font-size: 3rem;
    opacity: 0.2;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .standards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .species-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .contact-decoration {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero {
      padding: var(--space-10) 0;
    }

    .standards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .species-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .team-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-card {
      padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-5);
    }

    .contact-cta {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
